  "content": "\n\n<p><img width=\"1020\" height=\"129\" alt=\"我的世界標題\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/99b123fe-9b03-4565-a62f-29e581bc58ad\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Vurbin-Team/UIKit/blob/main/headlines/about_white.png?raw=true\" alt=\"所需模組白\" width=\"200\"><br></p>\n<p>一款柔和的降雪模組，讓《Minecraft》的冬天感覺溫暖、寧靜且令人安心。雪花輕柔地在您身邊飄落，營造出平和舒適的氛圍！</p>\n<p>此模組會「完全」停用降雨，並將其替換為降雪。</p>\n<p>建議搭配以下模組以進行設定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">cloth-config</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">modMenu</a></li>\n<li>搭配 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a> 使用效果更佳，可優化粒子渲染</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><a href=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f0a5717-d62e-416c-bda1-168e0ac79323\" rel=\"nofollow\">影片展示</a><br><br></p>\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1014\" alt=\"粒子雪景預覽\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2932c38c-1572-4866-a147-5285515f2fea\">",
